cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "wickra-synth"
abstract: >-
  A deterministic synthetic market-microstructure generator built on the Wickra
  core: a data-driven GenSpec and a portable seeded PRNG (SplitMix64 →
  xoshiro256++) produce OHLCV candles plus order-book snapshots, trades and
  funding, byte-identical for a given seed across platforms and exposed as a
  JSON-over-C-ABI data API in ten languages.
type: software
authors:
